;    6: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ほお, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=7, unk2=65280, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=6, unk2=16776960, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=7, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=48, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=6283, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=5608, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ムスカリの花.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>―<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> had gone out again to gather supplies.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE> had gone into her workroom and was analyzing the footage I'd shot.<PG>
I was sorting the supplies we'd brought in.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By rights, in cherry season, it should have been me going outside.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But for now there was no wind, and above all, I was at an age where I could feel myself getting old.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This time, I'd decided to leave it to <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.<PG>
Food, towels, paper plates, clothes, water, fuel.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now that we had to ration the utilities, almost everything would be single-use.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We would need a lot of things, and we'd have to work out how to get rid of the used ones as well.<PG>
If the three of us lived on disposables for as much as a month, there'd be a truly enormous amount of trash.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
However big the rooms are, I don't want to keep trash in them, and lining it up in the building's hallway will hit its limit sooner or later.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The town is empty, so we could always just leave it outside...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Once we start doing things like that, I'm a little scared we'll drift further and further from living like human beings.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We should choose as orderly a method as we can.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Thanks for your hard work. Sorry you had to do the tidying..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It's fine. We're the ones imposing on you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">How's the video analysis going?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes, about that, there's something I'd like to talk to you about..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan's</STYLE> eyes were very sharp.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently she'd found something interesting.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I stopped working and sat down on the sofa with <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"First of all, the cherry petals dissolving the body is just as I predicted. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I think you saw that too, so I'll skip it."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Yes..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
Skip the dissolving of the body?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That was all I'd filmed in that video, though.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, I'd like you to think back carefully... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Did anything strange happen while you were outside?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Something strange?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. Like, for example, seeing a figure."</STYLE><PG>
―!!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\クリスタルコア.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
I'd completely forgotten to tell her.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right, I had spotted a figure and followed the footprints.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I lost track of them partway...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I did see one, walking through town alone. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">I couldn't tell who it was, but there were footprints too, so someone was definitely there."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Did you follow the footprints?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I traced them backward. I wanted to find out where they came from. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But they stopped at the big cherry tree growing in Central Park."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"So you confirmed someone was there, but you couldn't find them?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I know. Maybe I should have followed where they went after all..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, in this case I think it was the right choice. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">If you had followed those footprints to wherever they led, who knows what would have happened..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you mean...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島うつむき32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Look at this, please."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ノートPC.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
What <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE> held out was a laptop.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On it was the video I'd shot.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That young woman's body, and cherry petals fluttering down from outside the frame.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The skin of the body the petals had been scattered on gradually began to dissolve.<PG>
―Even through a screen, I don't think there's anything particularly new to find...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島うつむき32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Did you notice?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"No, nothing in particular. It's dissolving exactly the way I saw it in person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"No, it's not the body you should be looking at. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone was standing outside the window."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"There was someone there. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Someone outside, staring hard in your direction, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\ホラー.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It can't be..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I checked the video again.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\ノートPC.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
At first the phone was pointed almost straight down, showing the body.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then the petals being sprinkled on...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
After that, to film the body from every angle, the view shifted lower, then higher.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From one particular position, the window happened to come into the frame.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\パソコン画面ぼけ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"This is it. It's blurry, but at the window, there's definitely a person."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A person...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is that... a person?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It does look a bit like a person, but...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I'll try enhancing the footage of that scene."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\解析音.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\パソコン画面.gal" "NORMAL" "5!" "5000" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey... is this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I had a feeling it might be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\解析音.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\パソコン拡大.gal" "NORMAL" "5!" "5000" "540" "1" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "0" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">You recognize this person, don't you?"</STYLE><PG>
I have never forgotten, not for a single day.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I have never once forgotten <STYLE ID="4">my own daughter's</STYLE> face.<PG>
But what if a <STYLE ID="4">daughter</STYLE> who could never appear were to appear right before your eyes?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before any joy, surprise and doubt well up, and then fear.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without realizing it, I was rubbing my arms with both hands.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had goosebumps.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes. I certainly do recognize her."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't make out her expression, but it was unmistakably <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My... daughter.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Then the one who left those footprints was </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"It's possible. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But... it's strange. Why is she here, and why is she fine outside? </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">I don't have a very good feeling about this..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"That's why you said it was a good thing I didn't follow the footprints."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"Yes. I have no idea what would happen if you met </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> is a danger...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"That I don't know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">But the footprints breaking off bothers me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> would have to have flown in through the air, or appeared on the spot out of nowhere."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True. Did <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE> just appear out of nowhere, or turn up by some means no one could imagine?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Either way, it's strange all the same.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
Just then, <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan</STYLE> glanced outside.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンションリビング.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"The wind's picking up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It is. Is </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> going to be all right...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"She's built so that if she stays out in the wind in cherry season, her April sickness comes on. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">And at the same time, her danger sense kicks in."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm going to look for </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. It'll waste one round trip's worth of elevator power, though."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"I think that's best. It'd be terrible if she collapsed outside."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I threw on a jacket and headed for the door.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\五島バストアップ32.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Um... please be careful. It looks like the clouds are turning ominous again. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">It seems this isn't a problem we can solve just by dealing with this toxic gas. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">There's the wind too, and please pay close attention to </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai's</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> precognition."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes, I'll be careful."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "700" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYMOVIE "桜吹雪風船なし.wmv" "256" "C" "C" "REPEAT" "FALSE" "100" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\市街地災害後3.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n11\r\n50\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Outside, the wind was blowing, and the storm of cherry petals made it hard to see.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The cherries blocked out the sunlight, and the temperature had dropped since earlier.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, this weather was the worst there could be.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had to get to her quickly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\nムービー\r\n3\r\n0\r\n3000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="STOPMOVIE">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―I hurried along what was a three-minute walk and reached the supermarket in 2 minutes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\SE追加\強風屋内.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE2" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\スーパー.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "懐中電灯" "グラフィック\背景\特殊\懐中電灯.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Are you here!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'd shouted as loudly as I possibly could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In this big space without a sound in it, my voice echoed well.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I heard nothing that sounded like an answer.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">! Aren't you here!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shouted again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
............
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I couldn't hear a thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe she isn't here.<PG>
Apart from here, about the only place <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> would likely go is the home center.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But there are still plenty of supplies of every kind here.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There should be no need to go all the way somewhere else.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I shone the flashlight here and there.<PG>
The flashlight...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That's right. This supermarket has no windows, so without a flashlight you can't even walk around properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I have it now, that means I never gave it to <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> went back to <STYLE ID="2">Goto-chan's</STYLE> apartment for a flashlight, it would use up elevator power.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, my guess is that <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> stopped by here but gave up on getting supplies here.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\五島マンション玄関.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
