<BR>
A person in white clothes went past.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Their appearance seemed almost to melt into the scenery, but that uncanny presence alone was more than enough to jolt my visual cortex.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
And right after that, the sound of the door opening.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> and I held our breath hard and curled up small.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Someone had definitely come in.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> had her eyes squeezed shut and her hands over her ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Knowing a threat that serious was coming, I tensed up even more.<PG>
"Excuse me, we've come to rescue you. Is anyone here?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The voice rang out so suddenly that my body shook for an instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A woman's voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Come to rescue us?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Really?<PG>
No, that's impossible.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I could hear her voice that clearly, she isn't wearing any kind of protective gear on her head.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In other words, no ordinary human could be alive.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Resisting that woman's sweet temptation, I hid my presence as completely as I could.<PG>
But this voice, from somewhere...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't think it's <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, though.<PG>
"I was sure it was here... my imagination, maybe..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\風呂ドア.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
Then right away I heard the door open, and the person's presence vanished.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> still had her eyes closed and her ears covered.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was it still too soon to feel safe?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I followed her lead and stayed curled up.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―How many minutes had passed?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE> gently took hold of my hand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\プリズン\コンビニ店内.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\プリズン\なつみ横顔32.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that woman just now...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Probably. If we're found, we'll be in serious trouble."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Can't you tell who it was?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can't tell that much, but..."</STYLE><PG>
Ten to one, that voice doesn't belong to <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Which means there's one more survivor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or did she, just like <STYLE ID="4">Haruka-chan</STYLE>, suddenly appear here?<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
